    },
    "Delete" : {
      "comment" : "A command on a bookmark of the Bookmarks list, as a button beside its row, a VoiceOver action, and a context menu item: deletes the bookmark.\nButton of a marker's row in the audio editor's list that deletes the marker.\nName of a filter preset's Delete button, also its VoiceOver action and context menu item.",
