    "The next episode could not be downloaded, so playback stopped. %@" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver announcement when the download of a feed's next episode failed. %@ is the download's own sentence saying why.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo descargar el siguiente episodio, así que la reproducción se detuvo. %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original audio was deleted on %@, so edits saved before then can't be undone." : {
      "comment" : "Said when Undo can't reach edits already saved, and the hint of a dimmed Undo in the audio editor: the book's original audio was deleted. %@ is the date it was deleted, in long form."
    },
    "The original is the lossless take a recording is saved from, or a copy of an audiobook's file from before its first edit. Keeping it lets every edit be undone without loss; a recording's costs about 345 MB an hour. A change also applies to originals already kept, and in a cloud library an original syncs with its book." : {
      "comment" : "Hint of the Original audio picker in Storage settings (Audio Editing): what an original is, what keeping it costs (345 MB is for an hour of a recording), and that a change reaches originals already kept."
    },
    "The pauses couldn't be found." : {
      "comment" : "Said when the audio editor couldn't find the audio's pauses. A sentence giving the reason follows."
    },
    "The reading list is empty. To add a book, choose Add to Reading List from its context menu, its VoiceOver actions, or the Library menu." : {
      "comment" : "Shown and read as the only row of the Reading List while it holds no book. Add to Reading List is the name of the command in the Library menu.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La lista de lectura está vacía. Para agregar un libro, elige Add to Reading List en su menú contextual, sus acciones de VoiceOver o el menú Library."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reading list is set to stop when a book ends" : {
      "comment" : "A sentence of the announcement as a book read from the reading list ends, after \"Finished: <title>.\": the list's When a book ends is Stop. Written without its full stop.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La lista de lectura está configurada para detenerse al terminar un libro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selection is all the audio; nothing to trim." : {
      "comment" : "Said by the audio editor's Trim to Selection when the selection is all of the audio."
    },
    "The stretch of the take to use isn't inside the take." : {
      "comment" : "Said when a punch-in's recording is asked to use a stretch that is not inside the recording."
    },
    "There's an empty filter between two commas." : {
      "comment" : "Problem found in a typed filter chain (the audio editor's Apply Filter and the filter presets): two commas in a row leave a filter with nothing in it."
    },
    "There's no audio after the cursor to preview." : {
      "comment" : "Said when the audio editor has no audio after the cursor to preview a filter on."
    },
    "There's nothing to redo." : {
      "comment" : "Said by the audio editor's Redo when nothing has been undone."
    },
    "There's nothing to undo." : {
      "comment" : "Said when Undo is asked for and there is no edit to undo, and the hint of a dimmed Undo in the audio editor."
    },
    "These edits need the original audio, which is no longer kept." : {
      "comment" : "Said when the edits wait to be rendered from an original audio that is gone. A second sentence says what helps."
    },
    "This Window" : {
      "comment" : "A choice of the Open the next book in pop-up button (Settings, Playback; Feed Info; Folder Settings): the next book opens in the window already open, in place of the book there.",
